  "translation": "Sisan, an ka Elohim, Ala bonba, jaamaba, min bɛ mɔgɔw siran, min bɛ layidu ani hesed mara, kana juguya ka dɔgɔya i ɲɛw fɛ — ⟨את⟩ bɛɛ, jugu min kunbin an na, an ka masaw la, an ka ɲɛmɔgɔw la, an ka sarakalasebagaw la, ani an ka nabiw la, ani an ka faaw la, ani bɛɛ i ka jama la, donw dɔ la, Ashur ka masaw tɛ, fo bi nin don na.",
